### CinemaAbyss Events Service HTTP Tests
### RFC 2616 compliant HTTP requests for testing Events Microservice
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://cinemaabyss.example.com
@eventsPath = /api/events

### ===========================================
### Health Check Tests
### ===========================================

### Health Check - GET request
GET {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Health Check with explicit headers
GET {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/health
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cache-Control: no-cache
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: health-check-001

###

### ===========================================
### Movie Events Tests
### ===========================================

### Create Movie Event - Movie Added
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: movie-event-001

{
  "movie_id": 1,
  "title": "The Shawshank Redemption",
  "action": "added",
  "user_id": 123,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
}

###

### Create Movie Event - Movie Viewed
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
