### ===========================================
### Error Handling Tests
### ===========================================

### Invalid JSON - Malformed request body
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: error-test-001

{
  "movie_id": 1,
  "title": "Test Movie",
  "action": "added",
  "user_id": 123,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
  // Missing closing brace - invalid JSON
}

###

### Missing Content-Type header
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/user
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: error-test-002

{
  "user_id": 100,
  "username": "test_user",
  "action": "test"
}

###

### Empty request body
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: error-test-003

###

