### ===========================================
### Edge Cases Tests
### ===========================================

### Large payload test
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: large-payload-001

{
  "movie_id": 999,
  "title": "Very Long Movie Title That Exceeds Normal Length Limits And Tests The System's Ability To Handle Extended String Values In JSON Payloads",
  "action": "viewed",
  "user_id": 9999,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T23:59:59Z"
}

###

### Special characters in data
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Request-ID: special-chars-001

{
  "user_id": 888,
  "username": "user@domain.com",
  "action": "special_chars_test",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T12:00:00Z"
}

