### ===========================================
### HTTP Method Tests (RFC 2616 Compliance)
### ===========================================

### OPTIONS request (should return allowed methods)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### HEAD request (should return headers only)
HEAD {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### PUT request (should return 405 Method Not Allowed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "movie_id": 1,
  "title": "Test Movie",
  "action": "updated"
}

###

### DELETE request (should return 405 Method Not Allowed)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### ===========================================
### HTTP Header Tests
### ===========================================

### Test with various Accept headers
GET {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/health
Accept: application/json, application/xml, text/plain
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Test with custom headers
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
X-Custom-Header: test-value
X-Request-Source: http-test-suite
X-Test-Case: header-validation

{
  "movie_id": 50,
  "title": "Header Test Movie",
  "action": "tested",
  "user_id": 500,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T21:00:00Z"
}

###

### Test with Authorization header (if implemented)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{eventsPath}}/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0
Authorization: Bearer test-token-12345

{
  "user_id": 600,
  "username": "auth_test_user",
  "action": "authenticated",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T22:00:00Z"
}

###
